{
    "title": "Car Out: Car Parking Jam Games",
    "description": "Car Out is an interesting parking jam 3d parking game. Be a park master in traffic jam parking games now!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude95In this car game, players continue to overcome difficulties here to fully get their car out of the parking jam. You will use your excellent parking technology to arrange all kinds of vehicles in sorting games to get car out of the parking lot. Save the parking jam in puzzle solving games now! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude99Game features:\r\n1. Be careful to scratch during car parking to avoid collision of the car.\r\n2. Unlock more cars at later levels by completing tasks in car parking jam.\r\n3. Easy to get on with but hard to become a park master! Train your nerve to find key clues in a huge parking jam and solve puzzle games in parking jam 3d!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude93Game introduction:\r\n1. Unique traffic jam car parking theme, use your wisdom to arrange each car perfectly.\r\n2. Cute asmr sounds and smooth control, offering excellent relaxing games experience in carparking.\r\n3. Exquisite models in 3d games, rich cars for you to choose from, the best experience for unblock me car game.\r\n4. Addictive puzzle games that don't need internet. Enjoy relaxing games wherever you want!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Car Out is an interesting parking jam 3d parking game. Be a park master in traffic jam parking games now!<br><br>\ud83d\ude95In this car game, players continue to overcome difficulties here to fully get their car out of the parking jam. You will use your excellent parking technology to arrange all kinds of vehicles in sorting games to get car out of the parking lot. Save the parking jam in puzzle solving games now! <br><br>\ud83d\ude99Game features:<br>1. Be careful to scratch during car parking to avoid collision of the car.<br>2. Unlock more cars at later levels by completing tasks in car parking jam.<br>3. Easy to get on with but hard to become a park master! Train your nerve to find key clues in a huge parking jam and solve puzzle games in parking jam 3d!<br><br>\ud83d\ude93Game introduction:<br>1. Unique traffic jam car parking theme, use your wisdom to arrange each car perfectly.<br>2. Cute asmr sounds and smooth control, offering excellent relaxing games experience in carparking.<br>3. Exquisite models in 3d games, rich cars for you to choose from, the best experience for unblock me car game.<br>4. Addictive puzzle games that don&#39;t need internet. Enjoy relaxing games wherever you want!",
    "summary": "Get your car out in car parking puzzle solving games, solve the car parking jam!",
